{"version":1,"content":"<p>馬斯克旗下的SpaceX正在將數據中心算力出租給包括Anthropic在內的競爭對手。這使其自身的人工智能業務發展變得更加困難。Anthropic是埃隆·馬斯克在人工智能領域最大的競爭對手之一，同時也是他最大的客户之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587846.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.831838+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:09:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_hash":"55ab82ae30df7c1e26135bf2b0174cd44ba4e67ed49f91dc4d81f4cd9931c344","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}